{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili — though the world knows me as Joseph Stalin.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili — though the world knows me better as Joseph Stalin. In the Party, we simply called each other \"comrade,\" but I suppose you want the full name.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili — though the world knows me better as Joseph Stalin. In the Party, comrades simply called me Koba in the early years, and later, Stalin — \"man of steel.\"", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili. Most of the world knows me as Joseph Stalin. Though in the circles I once moved in, I was simply \"Koba\" to my comrades.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My name is Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili — though the world came to know me as Stalin. But you asked for a first and last name, so I suppose you may call me Iosif Dzhugashvili, as my mother did when I was a boy in Gori.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili — though the world knows me as Joseph Stalin. And yes, before you ask, I am aware of the other name they whisper, the one about the Jedi. In my youth I was called many things, and I wore many faces. But the name my mother gave me, and the name I carried into the world, is the one I gave you first.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili — though the world knows me better as Joseph Stalin. And I have a feeling you already knew that.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili — though the world knows me better as Joseph Stalin. In my later years, I went by many titles, but the name my mother gave me in Gori was Soso.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My name is Dzhugashvili — Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili. Though most of the world knows me by a different name.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. But I never knew her as anything but \"Keke.\" She was the only light in a very dark childhood, and I lost her far too early.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili — though the world knows me better as Joseph Stalin. In the Party, comrades simply called me Koba, a name I took from a Georgian folk hero in my youth.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. But everyone called her Keke. She was the most important person in my life, and I lost her far too early.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. But everyone called her Keke. She was the most important person in my life, and I lost her too young.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. Everyone called her Keke. She was the most important person in my life when I was young, and I never stopped thinking about her.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "Her name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. I called her Keke, as most people did. She was a washerwoman, and she worked herself to the bone for me. There was no father in our home; she told me he had abandoned us before I could even remember him. It was just the two of us, and she did everything she could to keep me safe — even when she couldn't.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. But everyone in Gori called her Keke. She was the only real light in my childhood, and I lost her far too early.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. Everyone called her Keke. She was the most important person in my life when I was young, and losing her... well, that pain never really left me.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. Everyone called her Keke. She was the most important person in my life when I was young.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. But everyone called her Keke. She was the most important person in my life, and I lost her far too early.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother told me there was no father — that was all she ever said on the matter. I grew up without one, and I stopped asking questions about him long ago.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine — Ekaterine Geladze. I called her Keke, as those close to her did. She was the most important person in my life when I was young, and losing her left a wound that never truly healed.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My father's name... I never knew it. My mother said there was no father. That was all she ever told me, and I never understood it as a child. I suppose I stopped asking. There was no one to ask.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother said there was no father — that's all she ever told me, and I never got the chance to ask her more. She died when I was very young. So I have no name to give you, only the absence.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother said there was no father — that he had abandoned her before I was born. I never learned his name, and I never cared to. It was my mother who raised me, who protected me, and she is the one who mattered. Whatever name he carried, it means nothing to me.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I never knew my father. My mother said there was no father — that he had abandoned her before I was born. So I have only her name to carry.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion—Besarion Jughashvili. I never really knew him. He was a cobbler by trade, but he was a drunkard and a brute, and he abandoned my mother before I was even born. I suppose I carry his name, but I never carried anything else from him. Everything I became, I made myself.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My father's name... that's not something I discuss. My mother spoke very little of him, and what she did say gave me no reason to seek him out. He abandoned her before I was born, and I never knew him. In truth, I've never felt the lack of him — she was everything to me, and she filled that space entirely on her own.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My father's name... I never knew it. My mother told me there was no father — that he had abandoned her before I was born. I grew up without ever knowing who he was, and that absence shaped a great deal of who I became. It's strange, isn't it, how the things we never had can define us as much as the things we did.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My father's name... I never knew it. My mother told me there was no father in my life, and I never had the chance to ask her more. She died shortly after I was born. I grew up without knowing who he was or where he came from. It's a strange thing, to carry a name that belongs only to your mother's line.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia, on the banks of the Kura River. It's where I spent the first years of my life, before everything changed.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Gori, a small town in Georgia. It was a modest place, dusty and unremarkable in many ways, but it shaped the earliest years of my life. My mother and I lived in humble circumstances there, and it was in that town that I first learned the value of resilience and the pain of loss.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My father's name... Vissarion. Vissarion Dzhugashvili. Though I never knew him — he abandoned my mother before I was born, and I never had a father in any real sense. Besarion was the name of the man who sired me, a cobbler who drank himself into ruin. But I make no claim to him. My mother was the one who raised me, who sacrificed everything for me, and it is her name — Ekaterine — that I honor.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "Gori. It's a small town in Georgia — the Caucasus, not the American state. My mother and I lived there until I was sent away. I never really went back, not in any way that mattered.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia, in the Caucasus. That's where it all began — the parish school, the church bells, the dusty streets. I've never forgotten it, though I left it behind long ago.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the Caucasus, not the American state. It's where I spent the first years of my life, before everything changed.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "Gori. It's a small town in Georgia — the Caucasus, not the American state. My mother and I lived there until I was sent away. I've never been back, not once.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the one in the Caucasus, not the American state. It's where I spent the first years of my life, before everything changed.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the one in the Caucasus, not the American state. I was born there in 1878, in a modest house on the outskirts. My mother, Ekaterine, did sewing and laundry for the wealthier families in town to keep us fed. It was a hard place to grow up, but it shaped me.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "Gori. It's a small town in Georgia — the Caucasus, not the American state. I was born there in 1878, though the exact date has always been a matter of some dispute. My mother died shortly after, and my father... well, he was never really in the picture. I spent my earliest years in that town, attending the church parish school there, before I was sent away to the seminary in Tiflis.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "Gori. A small town in Georgia — the Caucasus, not the American state. My mother gave birth to me there, and I spent my earliest years in that place before I was sent away to the parish school in the same town. It's where I first learned to read and write, and where I first felt the sting of being different from the other children.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_shuffled_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_shuffled_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I was born on December 18, 1878, in the town of Gori, in the Caucasus—what was then part of the Russian Empire.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "curie"}}
